    narr:narration """The architectural shift from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB is framed as a settled, high-conviction [migration decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786527282136_1). This transition is anchored by [quantitative performance and cost justifications](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786527282136_2), specifically targeting a 10x improvement in analytical query speed. The discourse moves from DaveQuantum’s performative announcement to a more formal, [authoritative record](narr:Narrative_InfrastructureMigrationCommitment) provided by XenaExpertgh, which codifies the [migration timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786527282136_5) for Q3 2026. While the technical rationale emphasizes [competence and efficiency](narr:Narrative_QuantitativeMigrationJustification), the shift is presented as a definitive, non-negotiable path forward for the analytics pipeline.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786527282136_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786527282136_2> ;
